{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's Landlord Quest!! The point and click comedy game about the unsung hero of our time, the hardest working of them all, the humble landlord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as real estate titan Doug Gripp as he navigates his grueling schedule.\u00a0Think being a landlord is easy?\u00a0Well why don't you try it then, you communist!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for objects to pick up, combine, and use</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles with information found in the office</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hilarious dialog encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accomplish hidden quests to raise your Landlord Score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Landlord Simulator '93 minigame</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original  pixel art and music inspired by retro educational games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Own the town! Manage your\u00a0tenants!\u00a0Uncover the long lost\u00a0secrets of your father! <i>(After all, this\u00a0is an indie game.)</i>\u200b On your quest to\u00a0become the\u00a0greatest landlord in the world, you'll make some new friends, and maybe even learn a thing or two!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3919720?t=1759358527","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3919720?t=1759358527","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919720/f54c9a4d439b7a9699a58b76c7d69ddd3c2651d7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759358527","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919720/f54c9a4d439b7a9699a58b76c7d69ddd3c2651d7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759358527","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharin